      "was": "{\"access\":{\"roles\":[\"merchant\"],\"rule\":\"Only their own store\",\"who\":\"roles\"},\"errors\":[{\"code\":\"422\",\"when\":\"The window is under 14 days (a buyer's legal minimum) or over 365, or the colour is not a hex colour\"}],\"id\":\"patch-store\",\"method\":\"PATCH\",\"path\":\"/store\",\"requestShape\":\"store-settings-change\",\"responseShape\":\"store-settings\",\"service\":\"returns-api\",\"summary\":\"Change the return policy, branding or notifications; only what is sent changes. Buyers see it on their next lookup: nothing caches the store.\",\"writes\":[\"stores\"]}"
