  "roles": {
    "buyer": {
      "description": "Someone returning an order; proves it with the order number and its email.",
      "id": "buyer",
      "index": "a0",
      "name": "buyer"
    },
    "merchant": {
      "description": "Runs a store; signs in to the dashboard.",
      "id": "merchant",
      "index": "a1",
      "name": "merchant"
    }
  },
  "rules": {},
  "sections": {
    "7e5b1b42": {
      "body": "Goals\n- A buyer starts a return without contacting the shop.\n- A merchant sees every return in one queue and refunds in one click.\n- Money never moves twice for the same return.\n\nNon-goals for v1\n- Exchanges (return one size, get another).\n- Stores outside Shopify.\n- Carrier choice: one carrier, chosen by the merchant at setup.",
      "heading": "Goals and non-goals",
      "id": "7e5b1b42",
      "index": "a2"
    },
    "8aa479e5": {
      "body": "- Up to 200 stores in the first year; the largest sends ~60 returns a day. Peak a few requests a second; one Postgres is plenty.\n- A buyer page answers in under 500 ms at p95, label included only when the carrier answers in time.\n- Stale is fine for: store branding (an hour). Never stale: return status and refund state.\n- Must never be lost: a return a buyer submitted, a refund decision.",
      "heading": "Load and limits",
      "id": "8aa479e5",
      "index": "a3"
    },
    "ab22e75e": {
      "body": "- **Buyers**: bought from a Shopify store, want their money back with the least effort. Arrive from an email link or the store footer, usually on a phone.\n- **Merchants**: one to five people running a store doing 50–2,000 orders a month. Check the queue once or twice a day.",
      "heading": "Who it is for",
      "id": "ab22e75e",
      "index": "a1"
    },
    "f115e3c0": {
      "body": "Small online shops handle returns by email. A buyer writes in, someone looks up the order, emails a label, waits for the parcel and refunds by hand. It takes days and every step leaks: wrong items, lost labels, refunds forgotten.\n\nParcel gives the buyer a self-serve page to start a return in under two minutes, and gives the merchant one queue to approve, receive and refund.",
      "heading": "Problem",
      "id": "f115e3c0",
      "index": "a0"
    }
  },
